 "Guardar ajustes": "Save settings",
 "Has llegado a encadenar {n} pérdidas seguidas. En real, ahí es donde se suele \"revenge tradear\": decide antes cuántas pérdidas seguidas te hacen parar el día.": "You've had {n} losses in a row. With real money, that's where revenge trading usually starts: decide in advance how many losses in a row end your day.",
 "Historial": "History",
 "historial": "history",
 "La línea muestra la evolución de tu patrimonio; la raya punteada es tu saldo inicial. Por encima, vas ganando.": "The line shows your equity over time; the dotted line is your starting balance. Above it, you're winning.",
 "Las compras que has dejado programadas para cuando el market cap baje. Puedes cancelarlas desde aquí.": "Buys you've scheduled for when the market cap drops. You can cancel them from here.",
 "Las estadísticas se calculan sobre posiciones cerradas.": "Stats are calculated on closed positions.",
